mall/2-inch-deep-well-submersible-screw-pump57446439827.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">2 Inch Deep Well Submersible Screw Pump</h1>\n<p>2 inch deep well submersible screw pump 2 inch deep well submersible screw pump JIADI 2 inch deep well submersible screw pump Industry provides for the Plumbing, Septic, Waterproofing, Municipal, Industrial, and Maintenance Markets. We provide you with the opportunity to talk to a decision maker...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52498206\"/></p><p><strong>2 inch deep well submersible screw pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270948448937355.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>2 inch deep well submersible screw pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270948492498510.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI 2 inch deep well submersible screw pump Industry provides for the Plumbing, Septic, Waterproofing, Municipal, Industrial, and Maintenance Markets. We provide you with the opportunity to talk to a decision maker every time. Our goal at making pump is to become one of the leading pumps. </p><p><strong>1. Product Specification</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor type</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"116\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Brand Name</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor Power</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Protection Grade</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Insulation class</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2QGDa</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"116\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.2, 0.28, 0.37kw</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP68</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor Casing</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"116\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Q max</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor series</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Well Diameter</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Length</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"116\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1.4m³/h</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">QG</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&gt;55mm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">644mm/744mm</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><img alt=\"1\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201810301529001778015.jpg\" title=\"1\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Part</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270953163710318.jpg\"/> <br/>·100% pure copper wire<br/>·Low temperature and long lifespan for the motor<br/>·Food grade oil keep the water clean</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Outlet, suction chamber and oil chamber </p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270953274376501.jpg\"/></p><p>·Various choices: Stainless steel / Copper / Iron</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Stator<br/><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270953395041980.jpg\"/></p><p>·Cold-rolled Silicon steel with standard pieces<br/>·Work more efficiently and stably<br/>·Continuous operating guaranteed</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Mechanical Seal<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270953594156003.jpg\"/> <br/>·Graphite mechanical seal<br/>·Water proof and sand proof<br/>·To prevent oil to leak</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Control Box<br/><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270954106137518.jpg\"/> <br/>·Keep pump constant water pressure without motor overheated or overloaded<br/>·Fire-proof material</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Cable<br/><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270954206086952.jpg\"/> <br/>·Strong rubber protect the core<br/>·Cable is produced by JIADI</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>This pump is widely applied to household drinking water, farm irrigation, and especially the various fluid in the industry of pharmacy, chemicals, brewing, paper, food and so forth.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270955225803911.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image022(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Company profile </strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270955265106809.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image024(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI is dedicated to the design and distribution of the efficient and effective water moving products since 1998. Performance, reliability, energy efficiency and cost effectiveness are the most important priorities in our development process. JIADI members dedicate themselves to developing new and advanced products, bringing comfortable life to customers. We produce pumps like screw pump, drainage pump, sewage pump, peripheral pump and so forth.</p><p><strong>6. Our Services</strong></p><p>1. We will answer your question within 24 hours. Please offer us enough information so that we are able to provide you with the proper product.</p><p>2. Tell us your special requirements timely, we will design the product you want and arrange the production ASAP for you.</p><p>3. The superior material will be chosen and the quality pump will be made. </p><p>4. We will offer you one year warranty and within this period, the replacing part will be provided.</p><p><strong>7. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p>Terms: Ship, airplane and express.</p><p>Trade methods: FOB, CIF, CFR (CNF),etc</p><p>Lead time: Within 20-30 days</p><p>Packing: Carton (with cylinder or foam), plywood box</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270955322397272.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image026(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: Which mode of transport would be better?</strong></p><p>A: In general, we advice customers to make delivery by sea for large order, and for small order, Courier, By Air both ok. Also we respect your views of other transportation as well.</p><p><strong>2. Q: What information shall I provide you when I need your offer?</strong></p><p>Normally, please send me your flow, total head, medium, medium temperature, pump material, voltage, frequency, etc so that we can quote you exactly what you need.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Do you have Skype?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, please add for further communicating.</p><p><strong>4. Q: How far down could I put the pump in the well?</strong></p><p>A: About 40 meters deep.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Ho